      <p source="#source-33-86"><seg source="#source-33-86">今ここに君を見る　昔の姿そのままに</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-86-112"><seg source="#source-86-112">若き日に志したる</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-112-126"><seg source="#source-112-126">君が望み</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-126-161"><seg source="#source-126-161">君が年輪に添い磨き輝く</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-161-186"><seg source="#source-161-186">立派なる結実よ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-186-200"><seg source="#source-186-200">はじめて</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-200-217"><seg source="#source-200-217">君を見し時</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-217-273"><seg source="#source-217-273">君は人の家に我ならぬ日を送りてありき</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-273-296"><seg source="#source-273-296">君あまりに若く</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-296-322"><seg source="#source-296-322">こころ失わんとし</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-322-345"><seg source="#source-322-345">立ち出でんとし</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-345-364"><seg source="#source-345-364">路分かたず</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-364-384"><seg source="#source-364-384">われ君を祈り</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-384-419"><seg source="#source-384-419">祈ることを与えられしに</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-419-430"><seg source="#source-419-430">黒き手</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-430-456"><seg source="#source-430-456">十八の我を阻みぬ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-456-473"><seg source="#source-456-473">われは狂い</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-473-493"><seg source="#source-473-493">狂いたれども</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-493-527"><seg source="#source-493-527">我は君を離れたるなり</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-527-553"><seg source="#source-527-553">十数年の歳月去り</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-553-579"><seg source="#source-553-579">今ここに君を見る</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-579-602"><seg source="#source-579-602">立派なる結実よ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-602-616"><seg source="#source-602-616">手にとり</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-616-631"><seg source="#source-616-631">重みを捧ぐ</seg></p>
    </body>
